OL,4,G0700FSaturday Breakfast
OL,5,     GEleanor Oldroyd is live from
OL,6,     GMelbourne, bringing you the
OL,7,     Glatest news from the Fourth Ashes
OL,8,     GTest at the MCG. Plus the day's
OL,9,     Gnews and sport with Jeanette
OL,10,     GKwakye.
OL,11,G0900FPatrick Kielty
OL,12,     GPatrick Kielty presents a special
OL,13,     GChristmas edition of his show
OL,14,     Greflecting on some of the great
OL,15,     Gguests he has spoken to in 2025.
OL,16,G1100FFighting Talk
OL,17,     GBob Mills, Jake Brown, Richard
OL,18,     GOsman and Susie McCabe join the
OL,19,     Gfight for punditry points whilst
OL,20,     Gdiscussing the world of sport
OL,21,     Gwith Rick Edwards.
